====Usage notes====
* One of the four [[w:is:Ri-sagnir|ri-verbs]] in Icelandic, the other being {{term|snúa||to turn|lang=is}}, {{term|gróa||to grow; to heal|lang=is}} and {{term|róa||to row|lang=is}}.
* Even though some forms that include the letter {{term|e}} are pronounced as having an {{term|é}}, the e-spelling is thought to be correct by the [[w:is:Menntamálaráðuneyti Íslands|Icelandic ministry of education]]. The preferred spelling of the [[first person]] [[singular]] [[past tense]] [[indicative]] form of the word ''núa'' would thus be {{term|neri||I rubbed|lang=is}} instead of {{term|néri||I rubbed|lang=is}}, although both forms are used.

